    "description": "swissTLM-Map is an automatically generated map which offers a complement to the national maps in the scale range 1:5'000 to 1:10'000. swissTLM-Map is based on the data of the topographic landscape model swissTLM3D complemented by the contours and hillshade of the digital elevation model swissALTI3D.",
